Subject: [PATCH 0/1] vfio: Use the correct detach op in attach error path

vfio_df_ioctl_attach_pt() uses detach_ioas() op in the error path
regardless of the attachment type, that is whether it is PASID or device
level attachment.

Use the pasid_detach_ioas() op if the VFIO_DEVICE_ATTACH_PASID was
specified in the attach flags.

Sashiko found this existing issue while I was working on my IOMMU
persistence series for liveupdate.

Samiullah Khawaja (1):
